WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.020
Speaker 1: for those who were assuming that Lauren&nbsp;
Boebert reelection was a foregone conclusion,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:16.140
it may not be. It may not be. We have some&nbsp;
new polling that shows it's not as bad as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:21.840
maybe it seems. Axios reporting Lauren Boebert is&nbsp;
reelection in jeopardy. According to a new poll&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:30.720
by the numbers, Boebert received support from 47%&nbsp;
of likely voters. Democrat Adam Frisch landed at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:38.100
45. This makes the race a statistical tie within&nbsp;
the 4.4 plus or minus percentage point margin of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.620
error. 7% of voters are undecided. This is a&nbsp;
survey from September 29 to October 2nd taken&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:49.200
by Keating Research. It is a Democratic firm, but&nbsp;
it is also one of the most historically accurate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:56.100
pollsters in Colorado. This is a five point swing&nbsp;
towards Fresh. In July, it was Boebert 4942,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.760 --> 00:01:03.300
and this is a five point swing. The big&nbsp;
takeaway is that with Boebert under 50%,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:10.500
it means she is vulnerable to losing the race.&nbsp;
Fresh still has a lot of work to do, but it is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:14.700
something now it's important to understand. As&nbsp;
the Axios article points out, the third district&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:20.880
in Colorado overwhelmingly favors Republicans,&nbsp;
and it is not actually considered competitive by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:29.820
national experts. Typically. Typically, this is a&nbsp;
situation where the undecideds swing towards the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:35.280
Republican in that district. FiveThirtyEight&nbsp;
has one of these forecasts. It currently has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:45.960
it at a 98% chance of boebert being reelected and&nbsp;
only a 2% chance of Adam Fresh winning. Not a lot&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:52.380
of polling in this one. It is worth voting if you&nbsp;
live in the third district of Colorado. I know we&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:58.860
have viewers in that area because you've emailed&nbsp;
me about this race vote. Do not concede it costs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:05.460
you nothing to also fill out the ballot for member&nbsp;
of Congress. And if boebert could be defeated,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.460 --> 00:02:10.140
it would be a major victory for Democrats.&nbsp;
We will see. We will follow the race.

